        openings: ("A barber at a neighborhood shop with a steady Saturday crowd gave a customer a full haircut and a beard trim, and the customer walked out without paying, and the shop camera shows {D} walk out, and {DL} had stood in this court in {PRIORDATE} over {PRIOR}.", "The defense will say {D}'s card declined at the chair, and {D} went to get cash and meant to come back. {D} did not mean to cheat the barber."),
